Hi,

Yes, this has been fixed in the development version now at

https://github.com/flr/FLCore

> dim(ple at harvest) #still 10 iters
[1] 10 52  1  1  3 10
> dim(areaSums(ple at harvest)) #only 1 iter...
[1] 10 52  1  1  1 10

